  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Executive Office of the Secretary-General (EOSG) assists the Secretary-General on his engagement with member States and organs of the United Nations, and with specialised agencies and non-governmental organisations. It also assists on policy creation, implementation, and coordination of UN departments. The Sustainable Development Unit (SDU) assists to create supportive ecosystems for SDG acceleration at the local, national, regional, and global levels. This is particularly important following the 2024 Summit of the Future and subsequent adoption of the Pact for the Future.</narrative>
  </description>
